ok = "3" in ans and ("propiedad" in ans.lower() or "property" in ans.lower() or "jv_deals" in ans.lower())
```

The answer from Step 2 was: "¡Entendido! Vamos a proceder de inmediato. ### Resumen de Tareas y Acciones..."

So the approval went to the LLM, which gave a generic response. The fix should be: when approval is detected but there's no active action, AND readOnlyAuthorized is true, re-execute the last completed read-only action to give the owner fresh data.

